/ActualText (180 Degrees Consulting \(180DC\)  is one of the most recognised non-profit, social impact consultancies in the world. The brand itself represents our organisation and our community, whether it be visually or in the tone we use in our communications channels, and influences how our stakeholders perceive us.  Our brand aims to attract students, clients, and industry partners in helping us further our cause of creating meaningful impact. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
