/ActualText (As members of 180DC, we all have a part to play in creating and maintaining our brand experience. From individual consultants, to branch executives, to members of the Global Leadership Team \(GLT\), you play an essential role in advocating for the brand and portraying 180DC to the outside world. These Brand Guidelines help us ensure we build on our brand image and legacy together through a consistent and unified application of our brand, ultimately maintaining our brand safety.)
